Could you please introduce yourself with tech stack?
•	What are the different scopes available for beans in Spring?
•	If a singleton-scoped bean uses a prototype-scoped bean, will it work as expected?
•	API Versioning: You need to change an API without breaking existing clients. How would you design the new version?
•	Can you explain the Circuit Breaker design pattern?
•	How to implement a global error handling mechanism in a Spring Boot application to return consistent JSON error responses for custom exceptions like ResourceNotFound or InvalidException?
•	Scenario: Suppose you want to fetch the latest stock market data. Which would you use — Promise or Observable? Which RxJS operator would you use?
•	Can you explain Spring AOP? 
•	Database Connection Pool Exhaustion: Your database connection pool is exhausted. What would you check first? 
•	Scenario: Suppose we have a search bar in our application. Whenever the user types a character, a backend API is called. For example, the user types a, then ap, then app. We want to cancel the previous API call and fetch only the latest result. Which RxJS operator would you use?
•	Explain one major production defect and how you fixed it.
•	Multiple instances of the same microservice execute the same scheduled job. How would you prevent duplicate execution?
•	What happens when two beans of the same type exist without "@Qualifier"?
•	What is the role of "SpringFactoriesLoader"?
•	How would you scale read-heavy traffic?
•	Explain JWT structure and JWT authentication/validation flow
•	The same payment request reaches your API twice. How would you make the API idempotent?
•	Your API works locally but returns errors after deployment. What would you investigate?
•	Your database query is fast, but the API response takes 2 seconds. Where would you look?
•	A microservice calls another service that takes 10 seconds to respond. How would you prevent your application from getting stuck?
•	Your Spring Boot application throws OutOfMemoryError only in production. How would you investigate it?
•	How would you improve an API that receives 10,000 requests per second?

SDE-2 (Java) Interview — What Gets Asked?
Preparing for a Java SDE-2 interview?
Here’s a practical breakdown of the topics you should be ready for 👇

Round 1 — DSA
• Longest substring without repeating characters
• Merge overlapping intervals

Round 2 — Core Java
• How does HashMap work internally?
• equals() vs hashCode() — why do they go together?
• ConcurrentHashMap vs HashMap
• ExecutorService vs CompletableFuture
• Virtual Threads — when would you actually use them?

Round 3 — Spring Boot & Backend
• Dependency Injection — constructor vs field injection
• @Transactional — propagation and isolation
• N+1 query problem in Hibernate/JPA
• Redis caching — when and why?
• API idempotency — why does it matter?

Round 4 — System Design
• Design a Rate Limiter
• How would you handle millions of requests?
• How would you scale the system horizontally?